    {
      "id": "ROB-003",
      "category": "specification_sensitivity",
      "finding_summary": "The prompt was revised after reviewing the first run and the validation set was re-analysed, yet Section 4 presents the validation as an evaluation of the LLM on labels it has not seen.",
