    {
      "id": "ROB-004",
      "category": "missing_robustness_support",
      "finding_summary": "The three-run internal-consistency check covers only the relevant/not-relevant decision on 34 articles. No run-to-run stability is reported for opening date, date precision or location, which underpin the headline counts of dated projects.",
