      "claim_text": "October–December 2025 and May–June 2026 have the highest share of relevant articles, and February–April 2026 the lowest. This indicates that openings cluster before winter and summer holidays.",
      "assessment": "partially",
      "cannot_verify_reason": null,
      "evidence_summary": "Table 6 reports only totals and no period-by-period breakdown. With 92 relevant articles over about 13 months, month-level shares rest on very few articles. The claim moves from the share of relevant articles to when openings occur, although articles can report past or planned openings (as in the pilot). Dating is only day/month precise for 29 of 43 projects. The text itself notes few articles from July–August 2026. No comparison with the date distribution of the openings is given.",
